      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "Motion supports .MP4, YouTube and Vimeo product videos through a product image's 'alt' tag. Not all features supported by Vimeo. [Learn more](https://archetypethemes.co/blogs/motion/how-do-i-add-product-videos)"
